Modifications made by Mifsopo ("Mif"), 2026:

  * Ported the above from Unreal Engine 4.25–4.27 to Unreal Engine 5.3.2.
  * Hardened the disassembler for in-editor use against cooked BlueprintGeneratedClasses
    (per-opcode failure tracking, opcode histogram, safe abort on unknown opcodes).
  * Implemented value-semantic operator== / GetTypeHash on the intermediate terminal type
    (upstream left these as stubs) to key producer->reader dataflow maps.
  * Added the transformer (KismetBytecodeTransformer), graph decompiler
    (KismetGraphDecompiler*), ubergraph analysis/slicing, event-body reconstruction,
    and fidelity verification, which are original work built on top of the ported base.

